{"id": "33969", "title": "鬼丈夫", "author": "琼瑶", "category": "文学名著", "count": 22, "available": 0, "cover": "", "status": "已完成", "source": "files/article/info/33/33969.htm", "intro": "人死了，爱是否依然存在？！假如乐梅对起轩的爱不熄减，那心灵与魂魄直接感应的默契，是否能穿越阴阳两界？其实，起轩并没有死，只是无情的火苗将他纹身成丑陋的恶魔！这一切逼得他只好忍痛让痴情的乐梅抱著牌位成亲……鬼丈夫啊鬼丈夫，躲在落月轩里终日懊恼苦叹的起轩，索居的孤寂与落寞，是让周遭的亲人得到解脱，还是反而更深深地伤害了他们？……", "base": "files/article/html/33/33969", "chapters": [{"title": "第1节", "file": "2160208.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第2节", "file": "2160209.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第3节", "file": "2160210.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第4节", "file": "2160211.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第5节", "file": "2160212.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第6节", "file": "2160213.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第7节", "file": "2160214.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第8节", "file": "2160215.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第9节", "file": "2160216.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第10节", "file": "2160217.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第11节", "file": "2160218.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第12节", "file": "2160219.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第13节", "file": "2160220.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第14节", "file": "2160221.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第15节", "file": "2160222.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第16节", "file": "2160223.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第17节", "file": "2160224.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第18节", "file": "2160225.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第19节", "file": "2160226.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第20节", "file": "2160227.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第21节", "file": "2160228.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第22节", "file": "2160229.html", "available": false}]}